      292   DEFINE BUFFER X_sysconf FOR ub.sysconf.
      293   DEFINE BUFFER X_cli-obj FOR ub.clients.
      294   DEFINE BUFFER buf_dis-time-rule FOR ub.dis-time-rule.
      295   define buffer buf_units for ub.units.
